# Budgets

> Status: Ready
> Priority: P0
> Depends On: Categories
> Next Feature: Multi-Member

---

# Overview

Budgets help users plan and control their spending in Kin Finance.

A Budget is a spending limit set for a specific Category over a monthly period. Users can track how much they have spent versus their budgeted amount.

In MVP, Budgets are monthly per Category with no rollover. Both Owner and Member can create, edit, and delete Budgets. Budgets for hidden Categories are visible to Members.

---

# Goals

- Allow users to set monthly spending limits per Category.
- Help users track spending against their budget.
- Make Budgets fully accessible to all Household members.

---

# Scope

## In Scope

- Create a Budget for a Category.
- Edit a Budget amount.
- Delete a Budget.
- List all Budgets for the Household.
- Show budget vs actual spending per Category.

## Out of Scope

- Budget rollover (future).
- Weekly or yearly budgets (future).
- Shared budgets across Categories (future).
- Budget notifications/alerts (future).
- Budget suggestions based on history (future).

